  "description": {
   "en": "Taisho Exposition held in Tokyo in 1914. One day the city streets covering the venue and covering a radius of 2 km were blown to different spaces along with the typhoon. Since then, for 85 years residents were living in differently - sized towns closed from the outside world. In this town named \"Fukujin-machi\" and developed its own unique development, a mysterious phenomenon such as \"coming Fuku\" that people come from the outside world, \"reset\" where the memory disappears at the same time every day happens, a memory store, a retail store, Dubious craftsmen such as dreamers dare to dance. And today again a man got lost from the outside..."
  },
